# ── OS / editor cruft ────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.asv
*.m~

# ── MATLAB generated ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.mex*
slprj/
codegen/

# ── Data, cache and exports (never committed) ────────────────────────
# These live outside version control; see dependencies.md.
Data/
*.mat
*.csv
*.erp
*.i
*.Rhistory
*.BLE
ga.txt

# ── Vendored toolkits (kept locally, obtained externally) ────────────
# The app expects these on the MATLAB path at runtime. They are NOT
# tracked here; see dependencies.md for versions and sources.
/eeglab/
/eeglab2024.2/
/eeglabolder/

# ── Stray working folders ────────────────────────────────────────────
/dummy/
+uiextras/+jTree/Tree2.m

# ── src/webtree/ (WorkSpaceTree.m's JS build tooling) ─────────────────
# The build OUTPUT is vendored at src/WorkSpaceTree.html; node_modules and
# the intermediate (pre-inlining) bundle are not committed. See
# src/webtree/README.md to rebuild.
src/webtree/node_modules/
src/webtree/dist/

# ── The in-app help page ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# A copy of the rendered manual (manual/manual.html, itself ignored in
# manual/.gitignore) prepared for the app's viewer by
# Alakazam.buildHelpPage. It embeds every figure of the manual, so
# committing it would put a large binary-ish diff in history with every
# change to the text. Alakazam.onHelp prepares it when it is missing.
src/AlakazamHelp.html
# Left behind by the old Node.js help builder (removed in V0.4.4.1) in any
# clone that had built it: a pull deletes the builder's tracked files but
# not these, which would otherwise show up as hundreds of new files.
src/help/node_modules/
src/help/dist/

# Commit-message scratch files (never part of a commit).
_commit_msg.txt
_m.txt

# EEGLAB, when it is installed beside Alakazam rather than under
# Documents/MATLAB/eeglab. EEGLAB's own eeglab_update unzips the new release
# into the folder its dialog happens to be pointing at, which defaults to the
# working directory, so running it with Alakazam as the current folder lands
# ~157 MB and 4500+ files right here. Ignored by pattern, not by exact
# version, because the folder is renamed on every update.
eeglab20*/
WHERE_ALAKAZAM_STANDS.md
